WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.259 --> 00:00:02.251
(child grunts)

00:00:02.929 --> 00:00:07.921
(light music)

00:00:07.921 --> 00:00:10.401
- When my parents are making me breakfast,

00:00:10.401 --> 00:00:13.336
they like make a lot of coffee, a lot.

00:00:15.821 --> 00:00:17.836
Becaus they're parents.

00:00:17.836 --> 00:00:19.921
- Yeah, I once had it from my dad.

00:00:19.921 --> 00:00:22.703
I drunk it, I was like,
"Hmm, do I like this?"

00:00:22.703 --> 00:00:24.904
- Coffee stops you from growing.

00:00:24.904 --> 00:00:26.808
That's why I don't want to drink it

00:00:26.808 --> 00:00:29.149
because then I would be like this little

00:00:29.149 --> 00:00:30.978
for my whole entire life.

00:00:30.978 --> 00:00:33.675
Oh no, it's gonna be gross.

00:00:38.269 --> 00:00:40.261
- I don't like the smell.

00:00:40.261 --> 00:00:42.601
It's really disgusting.

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:44.351
- It smells like broccoli.

00:00:49.795 --> 00:00:51.061
- Uhm, good.

00:00:51.061 --> 00:00:52.045
- Ah.

00:00:59.318 --> 00:01:00.534
- I like it.

00:01:01.598 --> 00:01:05.686
- [Voiceover] Yeah totally,
spit back in there, spit it out.

00:01:05.686 --> 00:01:08.327
- It's almost as bad as asparagus.

00:01:08.327 --> 00:01:09.446
- Taste like oil.

00:01:09.446 --> 00:01:10.722
- My god, that's delicious.

00:01:10.722 --> 00:01:11.463
Can I take this home?

00:01:15.314 --> 00:01:19.977
- I'm doing one to 100, it would be zero.

00:01:19.977 --> 00:01:21.853
- This is better than hot chocolate.

00:01:21.853 --> 00:01:23.032
- I thought it would actually taste

00:01:23.032 --> 00:01:25.390
a little better than this.

